{"id":"456569647a49059c","group":"62","path":"62/62-cor-RCA0-complete-theory-model.md","title":"Consistent Complete Sentence Sets Have Countable Models in RCA0","display":"cor-RCA0-complete-theory-model — Consistent Complete Sentence Sets Have Countable Models in RCA0","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-cor-RCA0-complete-theory-model","aliases":["62-cor-RCA0-complete-theory-model"],"display":"cor-RCA0-complete-theory-model — Consistent Complete Sentence Sets Have Countable Models in RCA0","depends_on":["[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-L2]]","[[62-df-derivability]]","[[62-df-first-order-theory]]","[[62-df-countable-first-order-model]]","[[62-thm-RCA0-weak-completeness]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Corollary II.8.6","source_pages":[93,94],"source_pdf_pages":[111,112]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-cor-RCA0-complete-theory-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-cor-RCA0-complete-theory-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-RCA0-complete-theory-model — Consistent Complete Sentence Sets Have Countable Models in RCA0"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a408046bf675c1cd\" href=\"?note=a408046bf675c1cd\" title=\"62-df-first-order-theory\">62-df-first-order-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2d2dee77f85c5f81\" href=\"?note=2d2dee77f85c5f81\" title=\"62-df-countable-first-order-model\">62-df-countable-first-order-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"20079521d6d1a03f\" href=\"?note=20079521d6d1a03f\" title=\"62-thm-RCA0-weak-completeness\">62-thm-RCA0-weak-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Corollary II.8.6"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93</span><span>94</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>111</span><span>112</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\)</span>、UC 及算术双类可推导关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{S_2}\">\\(\\vdash_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lang}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathsf{Lang}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Snt}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Snt}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>；相容、完整及可证性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a408046bf675c1cd\" href=\"?note=a408046bf675c1cd\" title=\"62-df-first-order-theory\">62-df-first-order-theory</a>，Models 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2d2dee77f85c5f81\" href=\"?note=2d2dee77f85c5f81\" title=\"62-df-countable-first-order-model\">62-df-countable-first-order-model</a>；弱完备性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"20079521d6d1a03f\" href=\"?note=20079521d6d1a03f\" title=\"62-thm-RCA0-weak-completeness\">62-thm-RCA0-weak-completeness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}RCA0\\text{-}complete\\text{-}theory\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl[\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Snt}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\\mathsf{Cons}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Gamma)\\land\\mathsf{Complete}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\\exists\\mathcal M\\ \\mathsf{Models}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M,\\Gamma)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}RCA0\\text{-}complete\\text{-}theory\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl[\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Snt}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\\mathsf{Cons}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Gamma)\\land\\mathsf{Complete}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\\exists\\mathcal M\\ \\mathsf{Models}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M,\\Gamma)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由相容与完整，对于句子 σ，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pbl}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{Pbl}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Gamma,\\neg\\sigma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Pbl}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{Pbl}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Gamma,\\neg\\sigma)\\)</span>。左侧 Σ⁰₁，右侧 Π⁰₁，Δ⁰₁ 理解形成 Γ 的全部句子后果数集 J。J 相容闭合且包含 Γ，应用弱完备性。没有预设 Complete 蕴涵给定 Γ 本身 Closed，也不把这条推论扩大到一般相容公理集。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Corollary II.8.6；纸面页 93, 94；PDF 页 111, 112。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","exc